# Public HTTPS endpoint. Leave unset for the truthful browser-only enquiry preview.
# POST JSON: { name, email, organisation, role, users, workflow, message }
# Respond 2xx JSON: { "accepted": true } only after accepting the enquiry.
# The service must validate inputs, allow this site's origin and apply rate limits.
# Never put delivery-service credentials in a VITE_ variable.
VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
